  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): direct member of INV-fabov-kapit-mupit-tigoz-lurol-mulus-jivik-kajun (META: CLI args silently accepted without validation) — INV-fabov's mechanic enumeration explicitly names \"search subcommand silently accepting invalid filter values for kind, language, and limit\". Substantive siblings under that META: INV-nonag (compact --max-symbols/--coverage), INV-nufob (verify-claims taint flags), INV-mofih (verify-claims unknown claim types), INV-gapib (all --input wrong-view JSON), INV-jibof (positional path swallows bm.json). Code reference confirmed at cli.py:1598-1607 (post-slice header) and cli.py:6323-6327 (type=int with no positive guard)."  # c4fa
